#speaker: Courier
The streets are completely deserted tonight...

#speaker: Courier
I just need to deliver this letter to the tea master before dawn.

#speaker: Imperial General
Step away from the gate!

#speaker: Courier
Wait, who's there?!

#speaker: Imperial General
Someone who knows what is sealed in that envelope. Turn back.

#speaker: Courier
I can't. A promise is a promise.